  "body": [
    "Innovation and transformation in Government and Healthcare to enable better outcomes for citizens and society",
    "In 2023, generative AI gained widespread attention, fueling a surge in investment expected to grow exponentially. Projections indicate that generative AI is expected to account for 12% of total AI investment by 2027, a significant increase from the current less than 1%.",
    "Laife Reply collaborates with IEO to innovate diagnosis-therapeutic paths through personalised medicine, combining AI and Big Data in the Value Based Medicine platform.",
    "NHS Blood and Transplant (NHSBT) saves lives through the management of blood donation and transplant services across England. Airwalk Reply supported NHSBT in achieving its strategic goals through problem discovery, opportunity identification, and actionable recommendations. This work helps ensure blood testing services continue to save lives nationwide.",
    "Faced with a complex IT transformation, the Bank of England brought in Airwalk Reply to reset and deliver the programme. Through revised objectives, governance, and delivery frameworks, the team successfully modernised the Bank’s technology estate on schedule and within budget.",
    "Airwalk Reply was selected as the lead delivery partner to design‭, ‬build and run a greenfield‭, ‬fully cloud-native digital platform to support the 750‭ ‬users‭ for a central government restoration project.‬",
    "Airwalk Reply was selected as the lead technology implementation and delivery partner for a large government organisation in the United Kingdom. This has involved a greenfield design and build of its digital platform, built entirely on the Microsoft and Azure stack, whilst integrating with a host of other technologies, including AWS.",
    "We supported the largest American health insurance company in launching an online digital platform tailored for older adults in the United States with the goal of reducing loneliness and promoting a happier and healthier life by connecting like-minded users both virtually and in the real world.",
    "Reply’s insurance experts share their vision of the industry’s evolution, driven by technological innovation and global macro-trends.",
    "As of 30 June 2026, Assets under Management (AUM) increased by approximately €135 billion compared with Q2 2025, representing a 14% growth. Find out more in the extract from e*finance Wealth Management Reply's Quantitative Observatory."
  ],
